    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806">

                <pb facs="0666" n="550" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg550"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/12395.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary Dodge to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 25.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Special Commission of the President of <lb/>
                                the United States, Near the Mediators</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Niagara Falls, N. Y.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 1, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose to you
                    herewith copies of the English text of the protocols of the 1st, 2nd and 3rd
                    Plenary Conferences held, respectively, on May 20, May 23, and June 12 last,
                    which have now been received from the Mediators. Summaries of these protocols
                    with the more important portions of the text have been forwarded by me to the
                    Department immediately after each Conference took place and the Department has
                    also been fully informed of them through the Commissioners’ telegrams.</p>
                <p>While adding that a copy of the protocol of the Fourth Plenary Conference,<anchor
                        n="45" xml:id="d806-f1"/> the last so far held, will be forwarded as soon as
                    it is received, I have the honor [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Percival Dodge</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d806-a1.xml" xpointer="d806-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d806-f1" n="45" xml:id="d806-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; a summary of the proceedings and the text of Protocol No. 4 are to
                    be found with Mr. Dodge’s No. 24 of June 25, ante.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
